#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:5
#: 7abaf50628e94f49a35cb9148ee1a0cd
msgid "RichenPower Generator"
msgstr "RichenPower 发电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:9
#: f4aa69ed201e47feb3f5501daec78248
msgid ""
"The RichenPower H2 Hybrid and H2plus Hybrid generators can be used to extend"
" a vehicle's flight time by charging the battery in flight.  Feedback from "
"the generator including RPM, voltage and current allows the operator to "
"monitor the system via the ground stations."
msgstr ""
"RichenPower H2 Hybrid 和 H2plus Hybrid "
"发电机可在飞行中为电池充电，从而延长飞行器的飞行时间。来自发电机的反馈信息（包括转速、电压和电流）允许操作员通过地面站监控系统状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:11
#: 745f5c6e328742c9a92c1b46de775853
msgid ""
"A transmitter's auxiliary switch can be used to control the generator's "
"speed (stop, idle or run)."
msgstr "遥控器的辅助开关可用于控制发电机的转速（停止、怠速或运转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:13
#: ac66915b1cca401b8e73eacd4dab3599
msgid ""
"the driver for this device is not included by default in the firmware built "
"and available on the `Firmware Server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ . "
"Either the user must build his own firmware with this backend enabled or use"
" the `Custom Firmware Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"该设备的驱动程序默认不包含在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上构建和提供的固件中。用户必须自行构建启用此后端的固件，或使用 `自定义固件服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:16
#: 50bfb98e5f3440e5a39c352fd717eca9
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:18
#: 7d5acd66ea2d4a5ca84f37283d038d33
msgid ""
"The H2 Hybrid and H2plus Hybrid generators can be purchased directly from "
"the `RichenPower webstore <https://www.richenpower.com/shop>`__"
msgstr ""
"H2 Hybrid 和 H2plus Hybrid 发电机可直接从 `RichenPower 网店 "
"<https://www.richenpower.com/shop>`__ 购买"

