msgid ""
"The generator's serial output (\"#5\") should be connected to one of the "
"autopilot serial ports (e.g. Telem2)"
msgstr "发电机的串口输出（「#5」）应连接到飞控的某个串口（如 Telem2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-richenpower-generator.rst:27
#: e263ee0686aa406d807ebba33185b039
