"The generator's PWM input (\"#6\") should be connected to one of the "
"autopilot's servo outputs (e.g. \"AUX OUT1\", aka servo output9)"
msgstr "发电机的 PWM 输入（「#6」）应连接到飞控的某个舵机输出（如「AUX OUT1」，即舵机输出9）"

